00:31:02.068 --> 00:31:04.404
What do you mean? Collaboration?

731
00:31:04.487 --> 00:31:05.530
[Limit] That cat yesterday

732
00:31:05.613 --> 00:31:07.490
this morning
With the one presumed to be the mother

733
00:31:07.574 --> 00:31:08.741
He was found dead.

734
00:31:08.825 --> 00:31:10.702
And very cruelly.

735
00:31:10.785 --> 00:31:12.495
Who is that? That's not a human.

736
00:31:12.579 --> 00:31:13.872
[Symbol] This is it now

737
00:31:13.955 --> 00:31:15.957
internet cat ghost stories
Are you talking about that now?

738
00:31:16.040 --> 00:31:18.751
[Limit] Police say people are dead
No, I don't even care

739
00:31:18.835 --> 00:31:20.295
What kind of crazy bastard is this?

740
00:31:20.378 --> 00:31:23.506
Should he be publicly executed on television?
I'm coming to my senses.

741
00:31:23.590 --> 00:31:24.799
[Symbol] Oh, oh

742
00:31:24.883 --> 00:31:26.217
Maybe

743
00:31:26.301 --> 00:31:27.677
Have you seen mine?

744
00:31:28.469 --> 00:31:29.304
What do you mean?

745
00:31:29.387 --> 00:31:31.180
[Symbol] It’s the same as mine, now

746
00:31:31.764 --> 00:31:32.807
[Limit] I’m not even a superpower

747
00:31:32.891 --> 00:31:34.934
What did PD Kang write?
How do you know?

748
00:31:35.018 --> 00:31:36.978
[Symbol] He has superpowers and he’s a brat.
So, did you see it?

749
00:31:37.061 --> 00:31:37.937
[Limit] I didn’t see it.

750
00:31:38.021 --> 00:31:39.981
- [Symbol] You saw it!
- What, are you dreaming? Are you half asleep?

751
00:31:40.064 --> 00:31:41.941
[Symbol] Wow, what kind of bullshit is this?
Now this is the same as mine

752
00:31:42.025 --> 00:31:42.859
[Limit] It’s not bullshit.

753
00:31:42.942 --> 00:31:44.444
Anyway, while sleeping
Why are you putting your feet up on someone else’s chair?

754
00:31:44.527 --> 00:31:46.279
- What are you talking about?
- [Limit] That’s bullshit! To people

755
00:31:46.362 --> 00:31:47.739
[So Ryong] Stop, stop! Stop it, both of you.

756
00:31:48.948 --> 00:31:52.660
[Director Son] Hey
It's energetic here in the morning.

757
00:31:52.744 --> 00:31:54.329
[Snort] To the conference room

758
00:31:57.415 --> 00:32:00.960
Okay, so one PD item…

759
00:32:04.047 --> 00:32:06.341
cats in a row
I'm being murdered

760
00:32:06.424 --> 00:32:09.427
It's difficult to catch
Punishment is not easy under the current law.

761
00:32:09.510 --> 00:32:11.262
[Limit] The police
It's a hands-off situation.

762
00:32:11.346 --> 00:32:14.223
If you catch someone on air
First of all, the impact will be big.

763
00:32:14.974 --> 00:32:17.560
If your identity is stolen, immediately
I was wondering if it would stop the crime.

764
00:32:20.521 --> 00:32:23.191
[So-ryong] Yesterday, a PD
Accused of being the culprit who killed that cat

765
00:32:23.274 --> 00:32:25.443
- You look a little excited.
- [Limit] It's not excitement, it's anger.

766
00:32:26.027 --> 00:32:27.487
It's not because I'm being accused of being a criminal.

767
00:32:27.570 --> 00:32:29.322
What an innocent creature experienced
against cruelty

768
00:32:29.405 --> 00:32:31.908
perfectly normal
It's an autonomic nervous system response.

769
00:32:31.991 --> 00:32:33.534
[Soryong] Aside from the reasons,

770
00:32:33.618 --> 00:32:35.745
Is it identity theft or public execution?

771
00:32:35.828 --> 00:32:37.497
The approach was wrong from the start.

772
00:32:37.580 --> 00:32:38.748
[Director Son] Is it good?

773
00:32:39.415 --> 00:32:41.292
Than the celebrity disappearance case 20 years ago

774
00:32:41.376 --> 00:32:43.920
Much more timely and dramatic.

775
00:32:44.003 --> 00:32:45.838
- Try it.
- [So-ryong] Director!

776
00:32:45.922 --> 00:32:47.382
Lower your voice

777
00:32:47.882 --> 00:32:49.008
I am not a subordinate

778
00:32:52.804 --> 00:32:54.055
[Soryong’s sigh]

779
00:32:54.847 --> 00:32:56.224
What about items in triggers?

780
00:32:56.307 --> 00:32:58.017
Without hierarchy
With fierce debate

781
00:32:58.101 --> 00:32:59.936
Take direction and create depth

782
00:33:00.436 --> 00:33:02.397
Just one confirmation from the higher-ups like this
determined enemy

783
00:33:02.480 --> 00:33:04.107
Never once

784
00:33:04.607 --> 00:33:06.317
In the newsroom
I don't know how you did it

785
00:33:06.401 --> 00:33:07.652
[Symbol] Director

786
00:33:09.737 --> 00:33:11.322
Well, I wrote this.
please take a look

787
00:33:11.406 --> 00:33:13.783
- [So Dragon] Kang Ki-ho
- [Director Son] Oh, PD Kang?

788
00:33:14.367 --> 00:33:15.243
But why is this?

789
00:33:15.326 --> 00:33:16.786
Oh, that…

790
00:33:18.329 --> 00:33:19.455
[Symbol] Uh…

791
00:33:20.498 --> 00:33:21.666
cat incident

792
00:33:21.749 --> 00:33:24.252
I did it first
If you look there

793
00:33:24.335 --> 00:33:26.045
[Director Son] Then let’s do it together.

794
00:33:26.129 --> 00:33:28.589
I helped out a PD in my time as an assistant director.
All I have to do is create a piece of art.

795
00:33:29.173 --> 00:33:30.049
[Symbol] Yes?

796
00:33:30.133 --> 00:33:32.051
[Director Son] Kang PD is the assistant director.

797
00:33:32.135 --> 00:33:34.429
Looking at your profile, you seem quite brave.

798
00:33:35.346 --> 00:33:37.432
- Even if we are not Skye
- [♪ Heavy music]

799
00:33:37.515 --> 00:33:40.268
There must be a certain level

800
00:33:40.351 --> 00:33:42.895
An unfamiliar university
That was a pretty brave thing to write down?

801
00:33:47.942 --> 00:33:49.152
[sigh]

802
00:33:49.986 --> 00:33:52.822
At least to the general manager
I thought you were a righteous person.

803
00:33:52.905 --> 00:33:54.699
I was completely mistaken.

804
00:33:55.283 --> 00:33:56.909
[Soryong] I can’t take it anymore

805
00:33:58.870 --> 00:34:00.204
Here's everything from yesterday's conversation.

806
00:34:00.288 --> 00:34:02.081
If it continues like this

807
00:34:02.165 --> 00:34:03.875
Abolish the trigger you mentioned

808
00:34:04.584 --> 00:34:07.086
Officially make it public

809
00:34:07.170 --> 00:34:09.005
Doctor Trigger
I'll leave it to the police.

810
00:34:09.088 --> 00:34:10.757
That would be much neater.

811
00:34:15.887 --> 00:34:16.929
[Sound of door opening]

812
00:34:20.224 --> 00:34:21.142
[Soryong’s sigh]

813
00:34:23.352 --> 00:34:25.772
[Writer Hong] Honey, do you mean abolition?

814
00:34:25.855 --> 00:34:26.773
[Soryong’s sigh]

815
00:34:26.856 --> 00:34:28.357
[Daeyong] Huh? Oh team leader

816
00:34:29.525 --> 00:34:30.735
[Sound of door opening and closing]

817
00:34:33.613 --> 00:34:35.073
- Wow, Director.
- [Sound of door closing]

818
00:34:35.156 --> 00:34:35.990
How do we get here…

819
00:34:36.074 --> 00:34:37.909
Make sure your subordinates are educated properly.

820
00:34:45.917 --> 00:34:47.543
[Hando sighs] I really didn’t know.

821
00:34:47.627 --> 00:34:50.129
I have no interest in directing.

822
00:34:50.213 --> 00:34:51.881
I just
If only we caught the guy who killed that cat...

823
00:34:51.964 --> 00:34:53.466
[Symbol] That’s worse

824
00:34:53.549 --> 00:34:56.302
I am serious about directing.
For kids like me

825
00:34:57.136 --> 00:34:58.805
[In a choked voice] That’s what PD Han said.

826
00:34:58.888 --> 00:35:01.349
I feel even more embarrassed and hurt

827
00:35:02.225 --> 00:35:04.102
At least pretend to be desperate

828
00:35:11.609 --> 00:35:13.027
[Soryong] Fish oil, seeds

829
00:35:13.111 --> 00:35:16.197
- [Mobile phone vibrating sound]
- No matter what you know, it is oily resin.

830
00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:18.783
- [Mobile phone vibrating sound]
- [Soryong’s heavy breathing]

831
00:35:20.827 --> 00:35:22.328
[Crying] The team leader and I

832
00:35:23.287 --> 00:35:24.914
Are you ignoring it because it’s a local university?

833
00:35:24.997 --> 00:35:27.917
- [Sound of difficulty]
- [Symbol] Why aren’t you answering my phone?

834
00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:30.294
You too, try getting older, hey, the 9th floor...

835
00:35:30.378 --> 00:35:31.587
Is it two things at once?

836
00:35:31.671 --> 00:35:34.507
What are you doing with that elevator?

837
00:35:35.758 --> 00:35:38.219
You can just take the elevator up.

838
00:35:38.302 --> 00:35:39.804
- [Kiho crying] Take the elevator...
- [Soryong’s Sigh]

839
00:35:39.887 --> 00:35:40.805
[Tap sound]

840
00:35:47.311 --> 00:35:49.313
[bird chirping]

841
00:35:51.232 --> 00:35:52.817
[Soryong] Did everyone cry?

842
00:35:52.900 --> 00:35:54.360
[Siho] I couldn’t even cry half of the time.

843
00:35:55.153 --> 00:35:56.988
[So Ryong] Do you want to go to graduate school?

844
00:35:58.573 --> 00:36:00.825
Tuition fee is about 1 million won
I can add it to you

845
00:36:02.910 --> 00:36:04.036
[sigh]

846
00:36:04.120 --> 00:36:07.123
Is it metaverse or AI?
They say the world has turned upside down

847
00:36:07.832 --> 00:36:09.959
How can there be so much stagnant water here?

848
00:36:11.210 --> 00:36:12.628
It's obvious on the outside

849
00:36:12.712 --> 00:36:15.256
So they're the broadcasters.
Don't curse me

850
00:36:17.341 --> 00:36:18.384
us

851
00:36:19.343 --> 00:36:20.219
Is it gone?

852
00:36:22.680 --> 00:36:24.098
[Siho’s trembling breathing]

853
00:36:26.184 --> 00:36:27.476
[Kiho] Wow, that person is a real PD.

854
00:36:27.560 --> 00:36:30.855
Because I’m picky, I’m arrogant
I thought it was a cat

855
00:36:30.938 --> 00:36:32.982
I was a completely black fox on the inside.

856
00:36:33.065 --> 00:36:36.110
But because of that fox
Team leader, did you even give up on business trips?

857
00:36:36.194 --> 00:36:37.737
Are you crazy?

858
00:36:37.820 --> 00:36:39.572
Because of one PD
Are you giving up on Cha Sung-wook?

859
00:36:39.655 --> 00:36:40.698
sure?

860
00:36:42.283 --> 00:36:43.701
[after exhaling]

861
00:36:43.784 --> 00:36:45.912
I received a call from informant Cha Seong-wook.

862
00:36:45.995 --> 00:36:47.246
[cell phone vibrating sound]

863
00:36:47.914 --> 00:36:49.498
- [Mobile phone operation sound]
- [Mobile phone vibrating sound]

864
00:36:50.333 --> 00:36:51.542
[cell phone vibrating sound]

865
00:36:52.835 --> 00:36:55.171
[Soryong] And then
I got a call from a PD.

866
00:36:55.254 --> 00:36:56.380
Uh, PD Han.

867
00:36:58.049 --> 00:36:59.342
[Symbol] No, I…

868
00:36:59.425 --> 00:37:01.677
If it was Jo Hae-won, it was Cha Sung-wook's girlfriend.

869
00:37:01.761 --> 00:37:03.304
Did you find that woman?

870
00:37:04.513 --> 00:37:05.640
Awesome

871
00:37:07.058 --> 00:37:09.101
Cha Seong-wook will succeed

872
00:37:10.228 --> 00:37:11.395
Who said remove triggers?

873
00:37:14.232 --> 00:37:15.233
[Soryong] Don’t be scared

874
00:37:15.316 --> 00:37:19.070
A sparkly pretty guy like you
Don’t be scared by academic background or anything like that.

875
00:37:19.153 --> 00:37:20.738
I want to do that too.

876
00:37:22.448 --> 00:37:23.324
[sniffling sound]

877
00:37:23.407 --> 00:37:24.575
[So-ryong] And one PD

878
00:37:24.659 --> 00:37:26.160
you must be mistaken

879
00:37:26.244 --> 00:37:28.621
Stealing from others
I'm not that kind of person

880
00:37:28.704 --> 00:37:30.248
[Symbol] Hey, wait a minute.

881
00:37:30.331 --> 00:37:31.499
Wow, now…

882
00:37:32.166 --> 00:37:34.085
Wow, what, are you siding with him?

883
00:37:34.710 --> 00:37:36.337
Wow, I'm really starting to feel lonely.

884
00:37:36.420 --> 00:37:37.713
No, how about…

885
00:37:37.797 --> 00:37:40.466
Oh, I saw him for a few days.
Isn't that really too much?

886
00:37:41.175 --> 00:37:42.677
no, how can i do that
Does love change easily?

887
00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:45.179
Too much, what is love

888
00:37:45.263 --> 00:37:46.681
[Symbol] Hey, wait a minute, wait a minute

889
00:37:46.764 --> 00:37:48.307
Oh, just say it right here

890
00:37:48.391 --> 00:37:49.809
Is it me or a fox?

891
00:37:50.351 --> 00:37:51.185
Is it a cat?

892
00:37:51.269 --> 00:37:52.353
Oh, choose, quickly.

893
00:37:52.436 --> 00:37:53.312
Isn’t it cold?

894
00:37:53.396 --> 00:37:54.522
- [Punching] Let’s go
- [Symbol's groan]

895
00:37:55.356 --> 00:37:56.941
- [So Ryong] I caught a cold
- [Symbol] Oh, wait a minute, kid.

896
00:37:57.024 --> 00:37:59.777
Oh, team leader, just a moment.
I choose, quickly!

897
00:37:59.860 --> 00:38:01.070
[Door bell sounds]

898
00:38:01.153 --> 00:38:02.196
[Owner] Welcome…

899
00:38:02.780 --> 00:38:03.656
[Sound of door closing]

900
00:38:03.739 --> 00:38:05.241
[Owner’s awkward laugh]

901
00:38:05.324 --> 00:38:06.200
Is your arm okay?

902
00:38:06.284 --> 00:38:08.244
- It's okay, uh.
- [♪ Humorous music]

903
00:38:09.120 --> 00:38:10.788
Yesterday
Did you catch anything else?

904
00:38:10.871 --> 00:38:12.456
PD, you saw that this morning too.

905
00:38:12.540 --> 00:38:14.000
Wow, that guy is really evil, isn’t he?

906
00:38:14.083 --> 00:38:15.167
So

907
00:38:15.251 --> 00:38:18.754
Break up with me again
Have you ever seen a suspicious person like me?

908
00:38:18.838 --> 00:38:20.548
No, I just
I'll report it right away and hit you.

909
00:38:20.631 --> 00:38:22.300
- [Door bell sounds]
- [Owner] Welcome

910
00:38:22.383 --> 00:38:24.176
Oh, you bastard, where do you go to find this?

911
00:38:24.260 --> 00:38:25.886
[Limit] This is my contact information.

912
00:38:25.970 --> 00:38:27.305
In case something gets filmed

913
00:38:27.388 --> 00:38:29.348
If you see a suspicious person
Please contact me right away

914
00:38:30.057 --> 00:38:32.184
[Owner] Wait a minute
If you give this to me now

915
00:38:32.268 --> 00:38:34.395
Decided to broadcast on Trigger
Have you decided?

916
00:38:34.478 --> 00:38:35.896
Wow, this is PD Oh So-ryong.

917
00:38:35.980 --> 00:38:37.315
Bye! Really

918
00:38:37.398 --> 00:38:39.817
Wow, because there was a trigger
Now you're done with the criminal, right?

919
00:38:39.900 --> 00:38:41.319
uh? Catching it
It won't be a matter of time

920
00:38:41.402 --> 00:38:42.320
Right? Right?

921
00:38:42.403 --> 00:38:43.696
What kind of investigative agency is Trigger?

922
00:38:45.531 --> 00:38:47.825
Eyes that see people
So what do you have?

923
00:38:48.826 --> 00:38:50.244
[Door bell sounds]

924
00:38:52.121 --> 00:38:53.664
- [Owner] Email address is ‘1st degree’
- [Sound of door closing]

925
00:38:53.748 --> 00:38:56.083
Somehow it doesn't look cheap at all
This shameless bastard

926
00:38:59.712 --> 00:39:01.172
[Daeyong] Two defeated soldiers
Where have you been?

927
00:39:01.255 --> 00:39:03.215
[So-ryong] He’s not a remnant of the defeat, he’s an independence fighter.

928
00:39:04.592 --> 00:39:05.885
Where did you go?

929
00:39:05.968 --> 00:39:08.387
[Daeyong] The general manager
I went to investigate the confirmed item.

930
00:39:08.471 --> 00:39:10.598
[Symbol] Fox
Fast as a rat, very

931
00:39:10.681 --> 00:39:14.143
Ah, when the general manager shows up
call me

932
00:39:14.226 --> 00:39:15.394
[Daeyong] You
I have a temper tantrum

933
00:39:15.478 --> 00:39:18.314
It's nothing special
Because things are getting better

934
00:39:19.273 --> 00:39:20.524
[Kiho claps] Team leader!

935
00:39:20.608 --> 00:39:21.984
Please give me Mr. Han’s number.

936
00:39:22.068 --> 00:39:24.987
No, when did the new member join?
Is your business card not showing up?

937
00:39:25.071 --> 00:39:26.322
The company doesn't work, it doesn't work

938
00:39:26.405 --> 00:39:28.574
Kid, why did you use the PD number?

939
00:39:28.657 --> 00:39:30.451
[Symbol] Work, work

940
00:39:30.534 --> 00:39:32.661
Yes? With his help
They told me to be an assistant director.

941
00:39:32.745 --> 00:39:33.579
The head of the department

942
00:39:33.662 --> 00:39:35.373
With the momentum, I will even get your CP.

943
00:39:35.456 --> 00:39:36.624
[Symbol] Yes!

944
00:39:37.375 --> 00:39:38.292
[Choi clears his throat]

945
00:39:38.376 --> 00:39:39.668
Look at me for a moment

946
00:39:41.170 --> 00:39:44.340
[Substitute] Doctor Trigger
A fact-finding committee task force team has been formed.

947
00:39:44.423 --> 00:39:46.092
The former president is the general manager.

948
00:39:46.175 --> 00:39:47.927
According to intelligence,

949
00:39:48.010 --> 00:39:50.221
In the hands of the old president
There's already one CCTV.

950
00:39:50.304 --> 00:39:52.515
In the old building
There was no CCTV in the editing room?

951
00:39:52.598 --> 00:39:55.309
There's a CCTV that illuminates the hallway.
They say there's one alive

952
00:39:55.393 --> 00:39:56.394
The storage period is one month

953
00:39:56.477 --> 00:39:58.896
Our whole team came and went.
Does that identify the suspect?

954
00:39:58.979 --> 00:40:00.398
It's the opposite

955
00:40:01.482 --> 00:40:02.566
They said they found a stranger

956
00:40:02.650 --> 00:40:05.528
[Daeyong] A guy who shouldn’t be there
One was taken.

957
00:40:05.611 --> 00:40:07.863
- [♪ Interesting music]
-But if it's an eyewitness

958
00:40:07.947 --> 00:40:09.949
Chances are it's Dr. Trigger
It's getting higher

959
00:40:10.825 --> 00:40:13.411
Hey, if you're picky
Looks like we're caught

960
00:40:13.494 --> 00:40:15.746
Abolition is now
Did it come up to your throat?

961
00:40:19.667 --> 00:40:20.501
gentile?

962
00:40:23.629 --> 00:40:25.172
- [Student] Over there
- [Door bell sounds]

963
00:40:27.967 --> 00:40:29.718
I didn't hear it on purpose.

964
00:40:31.345 --> 00:40:33.848
In this neighborhood
I have a famous grandfather.

965
00:40:34.682 --> 00:40:38.018
He's a crazy old man who picks up waste paper.

966
00:40:38.102 --> 00:40:40.688
But that grandfather

967
00:40:42.273 --> 00:40:46.235
Burning a cat corpse
My friend said he saw it in person

968
00:40:46.318 --> 00:40:47.820
- Corpse?
- [Student] Yes

969
00:40:48.946 --> 00:40:50.281
There is also a video

970
00:40:52.908 --> 00:40:55.119
[♪ Meaningful music]

971
00:40:58.497 --> 00:41:00.124
[Hando’s painful breathing]

972
00:41:01.375 --> 00:41:03.169
Do you know where this grandfather’s house is?

973
00:41:03.252 --> 00:41:04.253
[crow crying]

974
00:41:04.336 --> 00:41:06.297
[Student] Because it’s a redevelopment area.

